@host=http://localhost:5118

### Root
GET {{host}}/

### Users API
GET {{host}}/api/users

### Full health report
GET {{host}}/health

### Liveness probe
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Readiness probe
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Simulate database down
POST {{host}}/api/demo-dependencies/database/false

### Readiness should become unhealthy
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Restore database
POST {{host}}/api/demo-dependencies/database/true

### Simulate external API down
POST {{host}}/api/demo-dependencies/external-api/false

### Readiness should become degraded
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Restore external API
POST {{host}}/api/demo-dependencies/external-api/true

### Full health report after restore
GET {{host}}/health
